        "prop": "name",
        "label": "名称",
        "formtype": "Input",
        "inQuery": false
      },
      {
        "prop": "score",
        "label": "满意度",
        "formtype": "Rate",
        "inQuery": false
      },
      {
        "prop": "date",
        "label": "日期",
        "formtype": "DatePicker",
        "inQuery": false
      },
      {
        "prop": "status",
        "label": "状态",
        "formtype": "Select",
        "inQuery": false,
        "dataOptions": [
          {
            "label": "已完成",
            "value": "done"
          },
          {
            "label": "待回访",
            "value": "pending"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "actions": [
      "add",
      "edit",
      "delete"
    ]
  },
  "notes": "formtype 铰链：初版「满意度在回访后录入」不指明控件，模型常落 Input/InputNumber；纠正给出「星级评分」→ Rate。"
}
